{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> is a challenging turn-based tactical game, blending the intensity of a board game with RPG mechanics (leveling up, skill unlocking, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersed in the dark universe of <strong>H.P. Lovecraft's work</strong>, you will explore iconic locations such as <strong>Innsmouth</strong> or the <strong>Mountains of Madness in Antarctica</strong>, while facing horrors from the <strong>Lovecraftian cosmology</strong>, including <strong>Dagon</strong> and <strong>Nyarlathotep</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as an agent of the <strong>Order of the Enlightened of Arkham</strong>, tasked with eradicating fanatical cults that have emerged across the globe. But your mission will not be without danger: the more you fight cultists, the tighter the grip of the <strong>Elder Gods' rage</strong> will become, threatening your mental and physical integrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its <strong>innovative blend</strong> of board game mechanics and turn-based RPG strategy, <strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> offers a unique experience and a true challenge for fans of tactics and cosmic horror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502940?t=1744438717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744438717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502940/71e6199dc7c6800be71387dc485bd140b05f76f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744438717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502940/71e6199dc7c6800be71387dc485bd140b05f76f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744438717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> is a challenging turn-based tactical game, blending the intensity of a board game with RPG mechanics (leveling up, skill unlocking, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersed in the dark universe of <strong>H.P. Lovecraft's work</strong>, you will explore iconic locations such as <strong>Innsmouth</strong> or the <strong>Mountains of Madness in Antarctica</strong>, while facing horrors from the <strong>Lovecraftian cosmology</strong>, including <strong>Dagon</strong> and <strong>Nyarlathotep</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as an agent of the <strong>Order of the Enlightened of Arkham</strong>, tasked with eradicating fanatical cults that have emerged across the globe. But your mission will not be without danger: the more you fight cultists, the tighter the grip of the <strong>Elder Gods' rage</strong> will become, threatening your mental and physical integrity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its <strong>innovative blend</strong> of board game mechanics and turn-based RPG strategy, <strong>Rage of the Elder Gods</strong> offers a unique experience and a true challenge for fans of tactics and cosmic horror.</p>","developers":["Novadream Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502940/cf7e77ffc2d4dc7e0c57a463b5c16c4ebc0dcda9/header.jpg?t=1744438717","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Rage of the Elder Gods","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 6 GB VRAM, AMD Radeon RX 580 / Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":